    "description": "Stage selected media bytes for owner review from any harness. Supply actual base64 file bytes from a host file reader. Up to 2 MiB. Use a stable proposal UUID for status and exact retries. When ChatGPT supplies a file reference, use mother_propose_media_attachment_from_file.",
